used in Greek text, about 8 nats of activation; eta in non-Greek text (e.g. a math variable)
gets a weaker value; the Latin word "eta" a little. Byte-level tokens that complete an eta
letter also count. Other Greek letters are near zero, except omega and iota, which get a
small value."""
