    "check the", "identify the", "evaluate the", "understand the": about -3.8 on "the");
  - medium after other action verbs ("reduce the", "improve the") and after place/time
    prepositions ("into the", "during the", "about the", "between the": about -0.9);
  - weak after "on", "to", "for", "at", "with" (about -0.3);
  - about zero after light verbs ("make the", "use the", "get the", "have the"), after
    "of", "in", "from", "by", "as", "if", "when", and after punctuation.
