  - consistent/match/contradiction/compatible                                    -> -0.3
  - "with" right after a cue word (including agree/line/consistent/match)        -> -4.0
  - "to"/"of"/"against" right after a cue word                                    -> -2.0
  - "the"/"a"/"its" right after a cue word                                        -> -1.0
  - "with" after associated/start/dealing/filled                                  -> 0
